    "text": "7 hours ago LAMAR COUNTY, Miss. (WDAM) - Units are responding to a structure fire in Lamar County Thursday afternoon, according to fire services. Lamar County Fire Coordinator Kyle Hill told WDAM 7 that a call came in at 2:58 p.m. about the fire near 4th Street in Hattiesburg. The first unit to respond arrived at 3:05 p.m. Read full article\n1",
